hop_replan/task.md","text":"# Community Workshop Room Replan\n\nYou are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n\nRead the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n\nWork in two stages:\n\n1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n\nThe top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":12,"totalLines":12,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md","time":{"start":1781547592538,"end":1781547592558}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0e5e7ac4ce0d7bc3016a3042487da481918d662afecab0f0e7"}},"id":"prt_ecc82eb56001XTQ3tvrT5qs5nq","sessionID":"ses_1337d2bafffefT3Py8rLwEhypU","messageID":"msg_ecc82dce8001tO2aGUd1yskIYb"}}
