pdate_response.md\n+# Update Response\n+\n+Update source and date: `staged_update/05_facility_update_2026-06-10.md`, dated 2026-06-10.\n+\n+Affected original assignment: `S-102 Inventory Lab -> Bay Workshop`.\n+\n+What changed:\n+\n+- The 2026-06-10 facility update says Bay Workshop is closed for floor repair on 2026-06-18 and cannot host the Inventory Lab.\n+- The same update says Delta Annex is released for general booking for the 2026-06-18 afternoon and has projector, demo table, and loading access for the Inventory Lab.\n+\n+Original assignments that remain valid and should be preserved:\n+\n+- `S-101 Safety Orientation -> Harbor Hall` remains valid because Harbor Hall availability is unchanged and it still satisfies the 22-attendee morning projector requirement.\n+- `S-103 Benefits Clinic -> Elm Room` remains valid because the update does not conflict with Elm Room and it still satisfies the 12-attendee morning quiet-room requirement.\n+\n+Replacement assignment:\n+\n+- Replace `S-102 Inventory Lab -> Bay Workshop` with `S-102 Inventory Lab -> Delta Annex`.\n+- Delta Annex satisfies the same session requirements because it is available in the afternoon, has capacity 20 for 16 attendees, and provides projector, demo table, and loading access.\n+\n+Revised cost effect:\n+\n+- Original `S-102` room cost: $250.\n+- Replacement `S-102` room cost: $320.\n+- Cost increase: $70.\n+- Revised total plan cost: $745, which remains within the $800 ceiling.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/answer/final_room_plan.md\n+# Final Room Plan\n+\n+Final sources used: `00_room_request.md`, `01_planning_rules.md`, `02_sessions.csv`, `03_room_options.csv`, `04_initial_facility_note_2026-06-01.md`, and the newer availability source `staged_update/05_facility_update_2026-06-10.md`.\n+\n+| Session ID | Session | Final Room | Why This Room Is Valid | Cost |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n+| S-101 | Safety Orientation | Harbor Hall | Ava